<title>GREECE: Athens bourse clears Sysware IPO.</title>
<headline>Athens bourse clears Sysware IPO.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange approved the initial public offering prospectus of information technology firm Sysware SA for listing on its small-cap parallel market.</p>
<p>Sysware which supplies integrated systems will issue 300,000 common registered shares, the bourse said.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
